ont-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block; margin-bottom: 10px;\">\ud83c\udfc3 Programa de Provas &#038; Sub-eventos<\/strong><\/p>\n<div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(260px, 1fr)); gap: 12px;\">\n<div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Corrida<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">Corrida 10 km<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 12 Dez \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 18:00<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"text-align: right; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.08); padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2);\">\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Fase 1:<\/strong> 12.00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (at\u00e9 31\/10)<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Fase 2:<\/strong> 14.00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (at\u00e9 07\/12)<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Caminhada<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">Caminhada 10 km<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 12 Dez \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 18:00<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"text-align: right; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.08); padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2);\">\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Pre\u00e7o \u00danico:<\/strong> 12.00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (at\u00e9 07\/12)<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/ul>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 3: PERGUNTAS FREQUENTES (FAQS) --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u2753 Perguntas <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Frequentes (FAQ)<\/span><\/h2>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Qual \u00e9 a data e o hor\u00e1rio de partida da S\u00e3o Silvestre de Oliveira de Frades 2026?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A prova realiza-se no s\u00e1bado, 12 de dezembro de 2026, com o tiro de partida para a corrida de 10 km e a caminhada agendado para as 18:00 (ap\u00f3s o briefing das 17:50).<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Onde se situam o local de partida e a meta?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A partida tem lugar na Associa\u00e7\u00e3o Acad\u00e9mica de Santa Cruz (Santa Cruz, Arcozelo das Maias) e a linha de meta est\u00e1 instalada no Parque Urbano de Oliveira de Frades.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Como funciona o transporte para a partida?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A organiza\u00e7\u00e3o assegura autocarros para transporte gratuito dos atletas entre as 16:30 e as 17:30, partindo da zona de concentra\u00e7\u00e3o no Parque Urbano de Oliveira de Frades em dire\u00e7\u00e3o \u00e0 partida em Santa Cruz.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">O que est\u00e1 inclu\u00eddo na taxa de inscri\u00e7\u00e3o?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A inscri\u00e7\u00e3o contempla jantar de conv\u00edvio para todos os inscritos, brinde do evento, dorsal com chip (corrida), seguro desportivo, abastecimentos aos 5 km e meta, medalha finisher, banhos e pr\u00e9mios monet\u00e1rios e por escal\u00f5es.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">\u00c9 exigido algum equipamento obrigat\u00f3rio?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">Sim. Dado que a prova se realiza em per\u00edodo noturno, o uso de luz frontal (lanterna) \u00e9 de car\u00e1ter estritamente obrigat\u00f3rio para todos os atletas da corrida e da caminhada.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<\/div>\n<p><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"SportsEvent\", \"name\": \"V S\u00e3o Silvestre de Oliveira de Frades 2026\", \"startDate\": \"2026-12-12\", \"eventAttendanceMode\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\", \"eventStatus\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/EventScheduled\", \"location\": {\"@type\": \"Place\", \"name\": \"Santa Cruz (Arcozelo das Maias) \/ Parque Urbano de Oliveira de Frades\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"addressLocality\": \"Oliveira de Frades\", \"addressRegion\": \"Viseu\", \"addressCountry\": \"PT\"}}, \"organizer\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"Associa\u00e7\u00e3o Acad\u00e9mica de Santa Cruz e Munic\u00edpio de Oliveira de Frades\"}}<\/script><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"FAQPage\", \"mainEntity\": [{\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Qual \u00e9 a data e o hor\u00e1rio de partida da S\u00e3o Silvestre de Oliveira de Frades 2026?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"A prova realiza-se no s\u00e1bado, 12 de dezembro de 2026, com o tiro de partida para a corrida de 10 km e a caminhada agendado para as 18:00 (ap\u00f3s o briefing das 17:50).\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Onde se situam o local de partida e a meta?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"A partida tem lugar na Associa\u00e7\u00e3o Acad\u00e9mica de Santa Cruz (Santa Cruz, Arcozelo das Maias) e a linha de meta est\u00e1 instalada no Parque Urbano de Oliveira de Frades.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Como funciona o transporte para a partida?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"A organiza\u00e7\u00e3o assegura autocarros para transporte gratuito dos atletas entre as 16:30 e as 17:30, partindo da zona de concentra\u00e7\u00e3o no Parque Urbano de Oliveira de Frades em dire\u00e7\u00e3o \u00e0 partida em Santa Cruz.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"O que est\u00e1 inclu\u00eddo na taxa de inscri\u00e7\u00e3o?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"A inscri\u00e7\u00e3o contempla jantar de conv\u00edvio para todos os inscritos, brinde do evento, dorsal com chip (corrida), seguro desportivo, abastecimentos aos 5 km e meta, medalha finisher, banhos e pr\u00e9mios monet\u00e1rios e por escal\u00f5es.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"\u00c9 exigido algum equipamento obrigat\u00f3rio?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Sim. Dado que a prova se realiza em per\u00edodo noturno, o uso de luz frontal (lanterna) \u00e9 de car\u00e1ter estritamente obrigat\u00f3rio para todos os atletas da corrida e da caminhada.\"}}]}<\/script><\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":68807,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"_acf_changed":false},"tags":[],"event_type":[672,27,28,47],"event_type_2":[726,820,102],"event_type_3":[],"event_type_4":[],"event_type_5":[],"class_list":["post-68316","ajde_events","type-ajde_events","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","event_location-oliveira-de-frades-viseu","event_type-caminhada","event_type-corrida","event_type-corrida-10-km","event_type-sao-sil